{"candidateAnswer":"A few close family members and a friend","evidence":"[D1:5 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Deborah: It was full of memories, she passed away a few years ago. This is our last photo together.\n[D2:1 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: Hey Jolene, sorry to tell you this but my dad passed away two days ago. It's been really tough on us all - his sudden death left us all kinda shell-shocked. I'm trying to channel my grief by spending more time with family and cherishing the memories. These moments remind me to live life fully.\n[D6:4 | 4:12 pm on 22 February, 2023] Deborah: The roses and dahlias bring me peace. I lost a friend last week, so I've been spending time in the garden to find some comfort.","itemId":"urn:uuid:aeea611a-15a4-596c-befe-f1289d81988f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0d6cd77336a77566e88fc47521dc8b5bd0ff747c948691f0bbb734894de8518d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which of Deborah`s family and friends have passed away?","referenceAnswer":"mother, father, her friend Karlie","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0d6cd77336a77566e88fc47521dc8b5bd0ff747c948691f0bbb734894de8518d"}}]}